  },
  {
    "path": "SakanaAI-AI-Scientist-v3-df83138/README.md",
    "line": "[our paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.18933):"
  },
  {
    "path": "SakanaAI-AI-Scientist-v3-df83138/docs/pipeline.md",
    "line": "The same reviewer is available standalone as `agsci review <paper.pdf> [--output review.json]`"
  },
  {
    "path": "SakanaAI-AI-Scientist-v3-df83138/docs/scripts.md",
    "line": "- Before each review-driven manuscript repair pass, `paper.sh` copies the current `paper.pdf` into `paper/final_<timestamp>/revisions/` so the draft history stays inspectable over time."
  },
  {
    "path": "SakanaAI-AI-Scientist-v3-df83138/docs/scripts.md",
    "line": "- Set `paper.ai_review=openai` on an `agsci investigate` run, or append `review` to `execution.phases` for the end-to-end orchestrator, to send the validated final `paper.pdf` to the standalone OpenAI-backed `src/aireview.py` reviewer. Both forms require explicit opt-in. This final assessment is separate from the optional review/repair cycles above and writes `ai_review.json` plus `ai_review.log` in the final paper directory."
  },
  {
    "path": "SakanaAI-AI-Scientist-v3-df83138/docs/scripts.md",
    "line": "- `agsci review <paper.pdf> [--output review.json]` runs the same reviewer standalone on any PDF, outside a pipeline run and without manifest bookkeeping; it reads `OPENAI_API_KEY` from the environment or the repo `.env` (`--env-file` overrides it) and needs `uv` on `PATH`."
  },
  {
    "path": "SakanaAI-AI-Scientist-v3-df83138/docs/scripts.md",
    "line": "- `paper/final_<timestamp>/paper.pdf`"
  },
  {
    "path": "SakanaAI-AI-Scientist-v3-df83138/docs/usage.md",
    "line": "  - Review output is stored as `ai_review.json` and `ai_review.log` beside `paper.pdf`, with status and paths recorded under `ai_review` in `paper/latest_manifest.json`. Review failures warn and publish the paper normally."
  },
